.git
**/.git
**/node_modules
**/target
**/.turbo
work
# Prepared Tailscale distributions must reach the web-pwa build context.
# Docker will not descend into an excluded directory, so each parent segment
# is un-ignored and every sibling at that level is excluded again.
.cache
!.cache
.cache/*
!.cache/pwa-tailscale-native-http
.cache/pwa-tailscale-native-http/*
!.cache/pwa-tailscale-native-http/distributions
coverage
*.log
